'''Cat Ears''' (猫耳は正義, ''Neko Mimi wa Seigi'', '''Cat Ears Are Justice''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. It was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]].

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (M): Slow duration increases by 20%.

